==Estonian==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|fiu-fin-pro|et}} {{m|fiu-fin-pro|*viici}}, from the same {{etyl|urj-pro|et}} root {{m|urj-pro|*witti||five}} as Finnish [[viisi]] and Hungarian [[öt]]

