==Finnish==

===Cardinal numeral===
{{head|fi|numeral}}

# {{context|colloquial|lang=fi}} [[five]]
#: ''Se maksaa '''viis''' euroo.''
#:: It costs '''five''' euros.

====See also====
* [[viisi]]

===Interjection===
'''viis'''

# said to ignore something
#: ''Sataa. Siitä '''viis'''! Menen silti ulos.''
#:: It's raining. '''I don't care'''! I'll go out anyway.
#: '''''Viis''' siitä!''
#:: '''Screw''' it!
# ''adverbially used only as a part of the phrase'' '''[[viis veisata]] jostakin''', "not to give a damn" (about something)
#: ''Leena '''viis veisaa''' pomonsa määräyksistä.
#:: Leena '''doesn't give a damn''' about her boss' orders.

